{
  "width": 612.0,
  "height": 792.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "8 SPQR: Great Battles of the",
      "x0": 45.2,
      "top": 25.053600000000074,
      "x1": 306.0,
      "bottom": 36.35820000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "4.2 LEADER CAPABILITIES: INDIVIDUAL",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 53.81099999999992,
      "x1": 282.12479999999994,
      "bottom": 65.81099999999992
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "ORDERS",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 68.2109999999999,
      "x1": 95.00399999999999,
      "bottom": 80.2109999999999
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "4.21 A leader may give Individual Orders (IO) to any friendly",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 83.5970000000001,
      "x1": 297.00099999999986,
      "bottom": 93.5970000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "combat units within his Command Range. Command Range is",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 95.5970000000001,
      "x1": 297.00199999999995,
      "bottom": 105.5970000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "measured using an unobstructed path of hexes equal to or less",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 107.5970000000001,
      "x1": 296.9749999999998,
      "bottom": 117.5970000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "than that range, traced between leader and unit. Count the unit’s",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 119.5970000000001,
      "x1": 297.005,
      "bottom": 129.5970000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "hex, but not the leader’s hex. A path is obstructed by:",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 131.5970000000001,
      "x1": 257.56299999999993,
      "bottom": 141.5970000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "• a hex occupied by an enemy unit",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 146.4770000000001,
      "x1": 185.64000000000001,
      "bottom": 156.4770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "• a hex in an enemy Zone of Control (ZOC)",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 159.91700000000014,
      "x1": 222.86000000000004,
      "bottom": 169.91700000000014
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "• or terrain a leader could not cross or enter.",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 173.3570000000002,
      "x1": 223.097,
      "bottom": 183.3570000000002
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "Friendly units negate enemy ZOCs for purposes of tracing order",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 190.57700000000023,
      "x1": 297.00999999999993,
      "bottom": 200.57700000000023
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "paths. All other paths are considered unobstructed. Command",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 202.57700000000023,
      "x1": 297.02,
      "bottom": 212.57700000000023
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "Ranges are calculated at the instant the order is given.",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 214.57700000000023,
      "x1": 260.51,
      "bottom": 224.57700000000023
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "4.22 An IO allows one friendly unit to conduct movement and/",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 231.9770000000002,
      "x1": 297.0079999999999,
      "bottom": 241.9770000000002
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "or Missile Fire, be rallied, etc., per 5.22. In each Orders Phase, a",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 243.9770000000002,
      "x1": 297.01899999999995,
      "bottom": 253.9770000000002
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "leader may issue a number of IOs equal to his Initiative Rating.",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 255.9770000000002,
      "x1": 297.008,
      "bottom": 265.9770000000002
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "Once a leader can give no more orders and cannot be activated",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 267.9770000000002,
      "x1": 297.0299999999999,
      "bottom": 277.9770000000002
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "again, flip the leader counter to its Finished side.",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 279.9770000000002,
      "x1": 239.42999999999998,
      "bottom": 289.97700000000015
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "4.23 A leader may give an IO to move himself, which counts",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 297.3770000000001,
      "x1": 297.02299999999997,
      "bottom": 307.3770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "against the number of orders that leader may issue in that Orders",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 309.3770000000001,
      "x1": 297.0139999999999,
      "bottom": 319.3770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "Phase. A leader may instead issue an Individual Order to a unit",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 321.3770000000001,
      "x1": 297.0089999999999,
      "bottom": 331.3770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "with which he is stacked and move along with it. The leader must",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 333.3770000000001,
      "x1": 297.06799999999987,
      "bottom": 343.3770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "remain with the moving combat unit and end up in the same hex.",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 345.3770000000001,
      "x1": 297.125,
      "bottom": 355.3770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "4.24 A leader, other than the Overall Commander (OC), who is",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 362.7770000000001,
      "x1": 297.00199999999995,
      "bottom": 372.7770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "in an enemy ZOC may not issue orders either to combat units",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 374.7770000000001,
      "x1": 297.0079999999998,
      "bottom": 384.7770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "or to himself, and thus may not move out of that enemy ZOC",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 386.7770000000001,
      "x1": 297.01899999999995,
      "bottom": 396.7770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "unless and until he is moved out of that ZOC by an IO from the",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 398.7770000000001,
      "x1": 297.0309999999999,
      "bottom": 408.7770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "OC (4.4). While in an enemy ZOC, the only IO an OC may issue",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 410.7770000000001,
      "x1": 296.987,
      "bottom": 420.7770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "is to move himself. See also 5.26.",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 422.7770000000001,
      "x1": 179.72000000000006,
      "bottom": 432.7770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "4.25 A leader who is Finished (5.15) may not issue orders.",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 440.1770000000001,
      "x1": 296.71099999999956,
      "bottom": 450.1770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "However, he may move, but only if ordered by his OC to do so.",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 452.1770000000001,
      "x1": 296.97,
      "bottom": 462.1770000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "4.3 LEADER CAPABILITIES: LINE COMMANDS",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 472.75100000000003,
      "x1": 296.96642400000013,
      "bottom": 484.75100000000003
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "4.31 An eligible leader, instead of issuing Individual Orders,",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 488.137,
      "x1": 296.98799999999994,
      "bottom": 498.137
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "may issue one or more Line Commands (given by the Line Com-",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 500.137,
      "x1": 297.12999999999994,
      "bottom": 510.137
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "mand Rating). Each Line Command allows the leader to order",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 512.137,
      "x1": 296.99999999999994,
      "bottom": 522.137
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "any/all combat units that comprise a Line (4.32). The units that",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 524.137,
      "x1": 297.01599999999996,
      "bottom": 534.137
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "may comprise a Line are listed on the Line Command Eligibility",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 536.137,
      "x1": 297.06399999999996,
      "bottom": 546.137
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "Chart for each scenario. There is no limit to the number of units",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 548.137,
      "x1": 297.012,
      "bottom": 558.137
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "in a Line that may be so ordered, and all the eligible units in a",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 560.137,
      "x1": 297.00299999999993,
      "bottom": 570.137
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "Line do not have to take part. Units in a Line do not have to stay",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 572.137,
      "x1": 297.03299999999996,
      "bottom": 582.137
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "together when they move, although to do otherwise is to court",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 584.137,
      "x1": 297.0169999999998,
      "bottom": 594.137
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "organizational disaster.",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 596.137,
      "x1": 137.012,
      "bottom": 606.137
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "4.32 Line Composition: In a reflection of training and discipline",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 613.537,
      "x1": 296.868,
      "bottom": 623.537
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "levels, as well as tactical usage, the units in most lines must be",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 625.537,
      "x1": 297.00100000000003,
      "bottom": 635.537
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "adjacent. Any space between units ends the line. In certain other",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 637.537,
      "x1": 296.9969999999999,
      "bottom": 647.537
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "lines, each unit must be within 2 (and occasionally 3) hexes of at",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 649.537,
      "x1": 297.0289999999998,
      "bottom": 659.537
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "least one other unit in the line. If there is an intervening space,",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 661.537,
      "x1": 297.0169999999999,
      "bottom": 671.537
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "it may not be occupied by an enemy unit, a friendly unit from",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 673.537,
      "x1": 296.9999999999999,
      "bottom": 683.537
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "a different line (Skirmishers and Velites are an exception, see",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 685.537,
      "x1": 297.01999999999987,
      "bottom": 695.537
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "9.2), or an enemy ZOC. The units which may use a two-space",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 697.537,
      "x1": 297.014,
      "bottom": 707.537
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "(or three-space) Line are noted on the scenario’s Line Command",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 709.537,
      "x1": 297.0140000000001,
      "bottom": 719.537
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "Eligibility Chart.",
      "x0": 45.0,
      "top": 721.537,
      "x1": 112.78999999999999,
      "bottom": 731.537
    },
    {
      "column": "left",
      "text": "© 2026 GMT",
      "x0": 263.9613,
      "top": 750.0107,
      "x1": 306.0,
      "bottom": 758.0107
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "e Roman Republic – 5th Ed.",
      "x0": 306.0,
      "top": 27.35820000000001,
      "x1": 404.26030000000003,
      "bottom": 36.35820000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "A Line can be of any length provided that the units meet the ad-",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 54.00700000000006,
      "x1": 566.9899999999999,
      "bottom": 64.00700000000006
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "jacency requirements and all the units in the Line have the same",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 66.00700000000006,
      "x1": 567.0239999999999,
      "bottom": 76.00700000000006
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "orientation—either Flank-to-Flank or (but not and) Front-to-Rear",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 78.00700000000006,
      "x1": 567.3049999999998,
      "bottom": 88.00700000000006
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "(see 7.1). For units In Column, treat the Flank hexes adjacent to",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 90.00700000000006,
      "x1": 566.9929999999999,
      "bottom": 100.00700000000006
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "the Rear hex as Rear hexes. If the units meet the adjacency re-",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 102.00700000000006,
      "x1": 567.0099999999999,
      "bottom": 112.00700000000006
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "quirements, but do not have the same orientation, only those units",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 114.00700000000006,
      "x1": 566.9200000000003,
      "bottom": 124.00700000000006
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "within the leader’s Command Range can be included in the Line.",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 126.00700000000006,
      "x1": 567.0219999999999,
      "bottom": 136.00700000000006
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "EXAMPLE: In the initial deployment for Cannae, the Carthag-",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 143.40700000000004,
      "x1": 567.004,
      "bottom": 153.40700000000004
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "inian Left Wing cavalry meets the Line eligibility requirements",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 155.40700000000004,
      "x1": 567.0179999999999,
      "bottom": 165.40700000000004
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "because they are all adjacent to each other and within Has-",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 167.40700000000004,
      "x1": 567.1190000000003,
      "bottom": 177.40700000000004
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "drubal’s Command Range. The Roman Velites are adjacent and",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 179.40700000000004,
      "x1": 566.991,
      "bottom": 189.40700000000004
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Flank-to-Flank so all can be included in the Line without being",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 191.40700000000004,
      "x1": 567.007,
      "bottom": 201.40700000000004
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "within a leader’s Command Range.",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 203.40700000000004,
      "x1": 457.303,
      "bottom": 213.40700000000004
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "HISTORICAL NOTE: Individual scenario adjustments to this",
      "x0": 319.5,
      "top": 222.40700000000004,
      "x1": 562.5049999999999,
      "bottom": 232.40700000000004
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "rule reflect tactical theory in different periods. For example, at",
      "x0": 319.5,
      "top": 234.40700000000004,
      "x1": 562.5029999999998,
      "bottom": 244.40700000000004
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Beneventum, the Triarii cannot use a two-space Line because",
      "x0": 319.5,
      "top": 246.40700000000004,
      "x1": 562.5029999999999,
      "bottom": 256.40700000000004
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "of the tactical theory that they were a Phalanx-like last line of",
      "x0": 319.5,
      "top": 258.40700000000004,
      "x1": 562.5209999999998,
      "bottom": 268.40700000000004
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "defense. By Bagradas Plains, the Romans had seen what el-",
      "x0": 319.5,
      "top": 270.40700000000004,
      "x1": 562.514,
      "bottom": 280.407
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "ephants could do to such a line and adjusted wisely (if not well).",
      "x0": 319.5,
      "top": 282.407,
      "x1": 562.4100000000002,
      "bottom": 292.407
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "4.33 Line Command Eligibility: A leader’s ability to issue",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 304.30699999999996,
      "x1": 566.8180000000001,
      "bottom": 314.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "a Line Command depends on his position in the command",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 316.30699999999996,
      "x1": 567.1000000000001,
      "bottom": 326.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "hierarchy and the type of Orders Phase. When giving a Line",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 328.30699999999996,
      "x1": 567.02,
      "bottom": 338.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Command, the leader must start his Orders Phase within 2 hexes",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 340.30699999999996,
      "x1": 567.0169999999999,
      "bottom": 350.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "of—and have a clear LOS (8.14) to—at least one unit in that",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 352.30699999999996,
      "x1": 567.0069999999998,
      "bottom": 362.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "line. Elephants do not block LOS in this case. The leader cannot",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 364.30699999999996,
      "x1": 566.999,
      "bottom": 374.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "be in an enemy ZOC. Those OCs with a 2 LC capability (e.g.,",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 376.30699999999996,
      "x1": 566.9999999999999,
      "bottom": 386.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Hannibal) must start the Orders Phase within the 2-hex range of",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 388.30699999999996,
      "x1": 567.01,
      "bottom": 398.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "both Lines to which they issue the LC. They may not issue one",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 400.30699999999996,
      "x1": 566.991,
      "bottom": 410.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "LC, move, and then issue another.",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 412.30699999999996,
      "x1": 451.08400000000006,
      "bottom": 422.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Overall Commanders",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 431.86699999999996,
      "x1": 409.19,
      "bottom": 441.86699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "The Overall Commander (OC) may issue Line Command(s) in",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 445.30699999999996,
      "x1": 567.004,
      "bottom": 455.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "his Initial and Momentum-generated Orders Phases.",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 457.30699999999996,
      "x1": 523.3,
      "bottom": 467.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Subordinate Commanders",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 476.86699999999996,
      "x1": 430.15999999999997,
      "bottom": 486.86699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "A Subordinate Commander may issue Line Command(s) in his",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 490.30699999999996,
      "x1": 567.0039999999999,
      "bottom": 500.30699999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Initial (non-Momentum) Orders Phase if:",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 502.30699999999996,
      "x1": 479.98,
      "bottom": 512.307
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "1. he starts his Orders Phase within his OC’s Command Range;",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 517.1869999999999,
      "x1": 567.009,
      "bottom": 527.1869999999999
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "or",
      "x0": 328.0,
      "top": 529.1869999999999,
      "x1": 336.89,
      "bottom": 539.1869999999999
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "2. he is outside his OC’s Command Range, and the owning",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 543.347,
      "x1": 566.8910000000001,
      "bottom": 553.347
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "player rolls a die, applying a +1 DRM if any of the units in",
      "x0": 328.0,
      "top": 555.347,
      "x1": 567.002,
      "bottom": 565.347
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "that proposed line are in an enemy ZOC, and that die roll is",
      "x0": 328.0,
      "top": 567.347,
      "x1": 567.02,
      "bottom": 577.347
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "the same as or lower than the OC’s Strategy Rating. If it is",
      "x0": 328.0,
      "top": 579.347,
      "x1": 566.9879999999999,
      "bottom": 589.347
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "higher, he may issue only Individual Orders.",
